# lean-ctx

Prefer lean-ctx MCP tools: ctx_read > Read/cat, ctx_search > Grep/rg, ctx_shell > bash, ctx_tree > ls/find.
Edit/Write/Glob stay native; ctx_edit only when Edit needs an unavailable Read.
